# NOTE: click on layer surfaces may not register in the harness
ipc shelf open
wait 1
shot feed-open
note The shelf card appears on the right (opened reached the Rust surface).
ipc shelf close
wait 1
shot feed-closed
note The card has faded away; desktop shows no shelf.
ipc shelf zone
wait 1
shot feed-zone
note The drop zone appears on the focused screen under the menu bar.
ptr click 960 30
wait 1
shot feed-zone-cancel
note Click cancels the zone (cancelZone): zone is gone.
# MANUAL: with items on the shelf (needs a drag source): Clear (click 1856,66) empties the shell's Shelf and the card shows the empty state
# MANUAL: with items on the shelf: Share (click 1826,66) opens the share sheet with the shelf's files
